# Static-analysis scanner images pulled by `scansuite install` / `update`.
# One image per line; a bare name is taken under the product's IMAGE_PREFIX,
# a name containing "/" or ":" is used verbatim.  Blank lines and # comments
# are ignored.
#
# Adding a scanner here reaches every client through `git pull` -- no rebuild
# of the installer, no re-push of a binary.
static
semgrep-local
semgrep
gitleaks
trufflehog
noseyparker
kics
osv-scanner
gosec
spotbugs
bandit
phpcs-security-audit
nodejs-scan
brakeman
security-code-scan
flawfinder
codeql
